                            "text": "Het <w>tuttige</w> meisje bleek heel erg goed te kunnen leren en gaf niets om modieuze kleding.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "The <w>frumpy</w> girl turned out to be very good at studying and didn't care about fashionable clothes.",
